# Barbershop Booking System Rules

## Business Logic

### Booking Constraints

- Bookings must be in the future (no past dates)
- Minimum advance booking: 1 hour
- Maximum advance booking: 30 days
- Operating hours: 9:00 AM - 8:00 PM (configurable)
- Time slots: 30-minute intervals
- No double bookings for same barber at same time

### Data Models

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD - Clear booking structure
interface Booking {
  id: string;
  customerName: string;
  customerPhone: string;
  customerEmail?: string;
  serviceId: string;
  barberId: string;
  dateTime: Date;
  duration: number; // minutes
  status: 'pending' | 'confirmed' | 'completed' | 'cancelled';
  notes?: string;
  createdAt: Date;
  updatedAt: Date;
}

interface Service {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  duration: number; // minutes
  price: number;
  description?: string;
}

interface Barber {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  specialties: string[];
  isAvailable: boolean;
}
```

## Validation Rules

- Customer name: required, min 2 characters, max 50
- Phone: required, valid format (country-specific)
- Email: optional, must be valid if provided
- Date/Time: must be within operating hours, not in past
- Service: must exist and be active
- Barber: must exist and be available

## User Experience

- Show available time slots only
- Display barber availability in real-time
- Send confirmation after booking
- Allow cancellation with reasonable notice (e.g., 2 hours)
- Show booking history for customers
